{
  "key": "mask-number-dive",
  "name": "Number mask dive",
  "style": "minimal",
  "aliases": [
    "mask transition",
    "dive through number",
    "number mask",
    "through the letters",
    "150 mask"
  ],
  "tags": [
    "counter",
    "mask",
    "transition"
  ],
  "summary": "A big number counts up, then the next scene appears inside its digits and the view dives through them until it fills the frame.",
  "how": [
    "A counter with an id counts up and holds; its supporting line exits just before the transition.",
    "The next scene uses transition { \"type\": \"mask\", \"from\": \"<counter id>\", \"duration\": 1.3 }: the mask starts on the counter's own letters.",
    "Make the next scene clearly different (dark versus light) so the window into it reads."
  ],
  "spec": {
    "title": "Number mask dive",
    "theme": {
      "colors": {
        "text": "#1D1D1F",
        "muted": "#86868B",
        "primary": "#2F6BFF"
      },
      "fonts": {
        "display": "Inter",
        "body": "Inter"
      }
    },
    "post": {
      "bloom": false,
      "grain": 0,
      "vignette": 0,
      "chromatic": 0
    },
    "sfx": {
      "kit": "soft"
    },
    "scenes": [
      {
        "id": "count",
        "duration": 3.6,
        "background": "#FFFFFF",
        "layers": [
          {
            "type": "counter",
            "id": "num",
            "from": 0,
            "to": 150,
            "at": 0.2,
            "duration": 1.4,
            "size": 340,
            "weight": 700,
            "color": "#1D1D1F",
            "letterSpacing": -0.04,
            "y": 40
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "devices. One dashboard.",
            "size": 46,
            "weight": 600,
            "letterSpacing": -0.025,
            "y": -170,
            "color": "#86868B",
            "animate": {
              "preset": "auto",
              "at": 1.0
            },
            "end": 2.2,
            "animateOut": {
              "preset": "auto"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "inside",
        "duration": 3.2,
        "background": "#05060A",
        "transition": {
          "type": "mask",
          "from": "num",
          "duration": 1.3
        },
        "layers": [
          {
            "type": "background",
            "style": "radial",
            "colors": [
              "#05060A",
              "#1B2A55"
            ],
            "intensity": 1.1
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Every one, managed.",
            "size": 96,
            "weight": 600,
            "letterSpacing": -0.025,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "animate": {
              "preset": "auto",
              "at": 1.2
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
